        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business you... \r\n\r\nBeautifully Extended 3-Bedroom Mid-Terrace Family Home with Off-Street Parking\r\nEarly Viewing Advised \r\n\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 75 Ennel Drive to the Dublin 5 property market. \r\nWelcome to 75 Ennel Drive, a beautifully maintained and extended three-bedroom mid-terrace family home, ideally positioned in one of Artane's most established and sought-after residential locations, this property comes with some amazing features such as a Full Rewire, and replumbed in 2020, Combi boiler - instant hot water. Two Outdoor sockets\"\r\n\r\nOn arrival, you are greeted by a private driveway providing valuable off-street parking, along with a well-kept front garden. A pathway leads to the entrance of this attractive family home.\r\n\r\nStepping inside, you will immediately appreciate the bright and spacious entrance hallway. The original front porch has been thoughtfully incorporated into the main living space, creating a larger and more welcoming entrance flooded with natural light.\r\n\r\nTo the left of the hallway is a generous family lounge featuring dual-aspect windows overlooking both the front and rear gardens. This bright and inviting room benefits from excellent natural light throughout the day, making it the perfect space for relaxing with family or entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nContinuing through the property, you will find a stylish ground-floor family bathroom which has been tastefully renovated to a high standard with quality sanitary ware and contemporary finishes.\r\n\r\nAt the rear of the home lies the true heart of the property – a superb extended open-plan kitchen and dining area. Designed with modern family living in mind, this spacious room offers an ideal setting for everyday life, family gatherings, and entertaining. The contemporary fitted kitchen provides an abundance of both eye-level and base storage units, while a dedicated laundry area adds practicality. Large windows, Velux roof window, and French doors combine to flood the space with natural light and create a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe French doors open onto a sunny, low-maintenance rear garden with patio area, providing an excellent space for outdoor dining, summer barbecues, and family enjoyment.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three bright and well-proportioned bedrooms, including two spacious double bedrooms and a comfortable single bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe current owners have also thoughtfully considered future expansion potential. A window has already been installed at the top of the stairs, providing an opportunity for prospective purchasers to construct a second bathroom above the kitchen extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions and building regulations.\r\n\r\nThis wonderful home has been exceptionally well maintained throughout and offers a fantastic opportunity for a growing family to acquire a turnkey property in a highly convenient and family-friendly location.\r\n\r\nArtane is a mature and highly desirable residential suburb located approximately 6km from Dublin City Centre. The area offers an excellent range of local amenities, including shopping centres, cafes, restaurants, sports clubs, and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for with a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools nearby. Residents can also enjoy numerous green spaces and parks, including St. Anne's Park and local community parks, offering excellent facilities for walking, cycling, and outdoor activities.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from superb transport links, with numerous Dublin Bus routes providing regular access to the city centre and surrounding areas. Harmonstown and Killester DART stations are within easy reach, while Dublin Airport is approximately a 15-minute drive away, making this an ideal location for commuters and frequent travellers alike.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a modern extension, excellent future potential, and a prime location, 75 Ennel Drive presents a fantastic opportunity to secure a quality family home in the heart of Artane.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
